OL,3,GNEWSAWater firm lifts lid on fats      
OL,4,Abeneath businesses                     
OL,6,FA water company is renewing appeals to 
OL,7,Fbusinesses to dispose of cooking waste 
OL,8,Fcarefully after uncovering build ups of
OL,9,Ffats, oil and grease underneath food   
OL,10,Foutlets.                               
OL,12,FSouth West Water found a "substantial  
OL,13,Fgrease build-up" at a flooded kebab    
OL,14,Fshop in Exmouth and also large         
OL,15,Fquantities of fats, oils and grease in 
OL,16,Fdrainage chambers at a Sidmouth cafe,  
OL,17,Fwhich were restricting the flow of     
OL,18,Fwastewater.                            
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
