OL,3,GNEWSAWater firm lifts lid on fats      
OL,4,Abeneath businesses                     
OL,6,FAdrian Robinson, sewer network         
OL,7,Fprotection team manager, said: "What   
OL,8,Fhappens beneath food businesses can    
OL,9,Fhave a real impact on the sewer        
OL,10,Fnetwork."                              
OL,12,FHe said it was important to dispose of 
OL,13,Ffats properly "to prevent blockages,   
OL,14,Freduce the risk of flooding and        
OL,15,Fpollution, and protect the             
OL,16,Fenvironment".                          
